-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copilot-pull-request-reviewer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Pull request overview\n\nAdds a project-owned OTel Weaver schema registry under `schemas/otelc/` to serve as a CI-validated, machine-readable contract for the telemetry emitted by this repository’s compile-time instrumentations, and wires validation into the existing semconv tooling/CI.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Introduces a local Weaver registry (`schemas/otelc/`) with an initial `net/http` metrics contract and a pinned upstream semconv dependency.\n- Adds Docker/Podman-based scripts to fetch the pinned upstream semconv and to lint the local registry with an allowlist filter for expected duplicate-metric diagnostics.\n- Updates Make targets, CI workflow triggers, documentation, and ignores/formatting exclusions to support the new registry workflow.\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 10 out of 11 changed files in this pull request and generated 1 comment.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| scripts/semconv/lint-schema.sh | Runs `weaver registry check` from an OCI image and filters diagnostics for CI-friendly failure behavior. |\r\n| scripts/semconv/lint-schema-filter.jq | Allowlists only the expected `DuplicateMetricName` diagnostic between upstream and `otelc`. |\r\n| scripts/semconv/fetch-upstream-semconv.sh | Pre-fetches the pinned upstream semantic conventions into `schemas/otelc/.deps/`. |\r\n| schemas/otelc/registry_manifest.yaml | Defines the `otelc` Weaver registry and its pinned upstream dependency. |\r\n| schemas/otelc/README.md | Documents the local registry structure and `make lint-schema` usage. |\r\n| schemas/otelc/groups/http.yaml | Declares the initial `net/http` client/server metric emission contract. |\r\n| Makefile | Adds `fetch-upstream-semconv` / `lint-schema` targets and points `lint/semantic-conventions` at the local registry validation. |\r\n| docs/semantic-conventions.md | Updates documentation to describe the local registry workflow and CI checks. |\r\n| .tools/yamlfmt | Excludes generated `.deps/` cache from YAML formatting. |\r\n| .gitignore | Ignores `schemas/otelc/.deps/` upstream cache directory. |\r\n| .github/workflows/check-registry-diff.yaml | Updates CI to validate the local registry and adds a manifest-vs-`.semconv-version` consistency guard. |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-inst